original_text: ["Creatures you control have horsemanship. (They can't be blocked except by creatures with horsemanship.)", 'Each creature assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains double strike until end of turn.', "Flash\\nCreature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield have flash.\\nEach opponent can cast spells only any time he or she could cast a sorcery.", 'Flying\\nWhen Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Flying\\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Flying\\n{X}{UB}: Choose a color. Target opponent exiles the top X cards of his or her library. For each card of the chosen color exiled this way, put a 1/1 blue and black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', "Green mana doesn't empty from your mana pool as steps and phases end.\\nOmnath, Locus of Mana gets +1/+1 for each green mana in your mana pool.", "Haste\\n{T}: Put a token that's a copy of target nonlegendary creature you control onto the battlefield. That token has haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Mikaeus, the Lunarch enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mikaeus.\\n{T}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Mikaeus: Put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', "Protection from everything\\nIf Progenitus would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Progenitus and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", 'When you cast Ulamog, the Infinite Gyre, destroy target permanent.\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nUlamog is indestructible.\\nWhen Ulamog is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles his or her graveyard into his or her library.', "Whenever another creature dies, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Kresh the Bloodbraided, where X is that creature's power.", '{T}: Search your library for a legendary card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Target opponent discards two cards. Activate this ability only during your turn, before attackers are declared.']
